title ENVO Resolution and Dictionary Export

participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant Metadata
participant EnvoCache as _cache/ontology_envo_cache.json
participant OLS4 as EBI OLS4 API
participant Results

Notebook->Pipeline: enrich_envo_columns(metadata_df)
Pipeline->EnvoCache: Load local ENVO cache if present
Pipeline->Metadata: Scan candidate columns for ENVO IDs

Pipeline->EnvoCache: For each ENVO term, check local cache
Pipeline->OLS4: Fetch missing terms from OLS4 API
OLS4->Pipeline: Return label and definition or fallback
Pipeline->Metadata: Add *_label and *_definition columns

Pipeline->EnvoCache: Persist updated local cache
Pipeline->Results: Write ENVO_Term_Dictionary.csv
Pipeline->Notebook: Return enriched metadata and ENVO report